; Once a client has reported what is in view, it draws only that and the
; focused column; the rest are placeholders of the same size, showing
; their part's title.
> (strip-report! desktop (list (views:id vb) (views:id vd)))
> (strip desktop)
(4 nearest 4 ((3 placeholder) 4 6 (7 placeholder)))
